410
00:26:31,840 --> 00:26:34,540
客席が居ようがいまいが関係ない
It doesn't matter if the audience is big or small,

411
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:37,240
会場が大きい小さいとか気にしない
No matter the venue size, we'll give it our all.

412
00:26:37,440 --> 00:26:42,540
ちゃんと見えてる君のサイリウムは
I see your lightsticks clearly shining bright,

413
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:47,940
今はフーッと吹けば飛ぶような 小さな小さな才能だけど
A tiny, fragile talent that could blow away with the night,

414
00:26:48,040 --> 00:26:51,940
私を 推して くれるのなら
If you're going to support and cheer for me,

415
00:26:52,040 --> 00:26:57,040
アナタが 味方で いてくれたら
As long as you stay by my side as my ally,

416
00:26:57,240 --> 00:27:00,690
爆レスをあげる
I'll give you maximum fan service!

417
00:27:01,840 --> 00:27:04,540
アナタのアイドル
I'm your idol,

418
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:07,590
サインは B ▽
and your sign is B♡

419
