479
00:35:38,256 --> 00:35:42,256
すてきな天使に
A wonderful angel!

480
00:35:43,056 --> 00:35:46,556
卒業は終わりじゃない
Graduation isn't the end,

481
00:35:46,856 --> 00:35:50,556
これからも仲間だから
we're still friends from here on out.

482
00:35:51,256 --> 00:35:54,556
大好きって言うなら
If I say "I love you",

483
00:35:54,856 --> 00:35:58,556
大大好きって返すよ
I'll reply with "I love you so much!"

484
00:35:59,256 --> 00:36:02,556
忘れ物もうないよね
Nothing left behind, right?

485
00:36:03,056 --> 00:36:08,556
ずっと永遠に一緒だよ
We'll be together forever!

486
00:37:07,456 --> 00:37:10,056
ラストチャンスに飢えた爪先が
Starving for a final chance, my toes

487
00:37:10,256 --> 00:37:13,556
踊り出すまま駆けけたこの夜空
dashed across this night sky as I danced on.

488
00:37:13,956 --> 00:37:16,856
並のスタンスじゃナビかない
An ordinary stance won't get me through.

489
00:37:17,056 --> 00:37:19,856
星は宝石の憧れ
Stars are the yearning of jewels,

490
00:37:20,156 --> 00:37:22,906
浮かぶ涙と汗は血の名残り
floating tears and sweat are the remnants of blood.

491
00:37:23,056 --> 00:37:25,906
目の中でしか泳げなきゃ芝居
If I can only swim in my eyes, it's just a play,

492
00:37:26,056 --> 00:37:28,906
だけどステージが逃がさない
but the stage won't let me escape.

493
00:37:29,106 --> 00:37:32,906
いついつまでも憧れ 焦がれているよ
Yearning forever and ever, I'm burning with desire.

494
