始めないなら高をくくるよ
If you won't start, I'll take it lightly.

505
00:38:19,056 --> 00:38:21,856
楽になる日はまず来ない
The day we find relief will never come first.

506
00:38:22,056 --> 00:38:27,956
日々の中に集まる 悲しい光
A sorrowful light gathering within everyday life.

507
00:38:30,056 --> 00:38:33,056
生まれつきだっての底なし
Bottomless since birth, you see.

508
00:38:33,856 --> 00:38:36,856
This lie is love. And this lie is a gift to the world.

509
00:38:37,106 --> 00:38:40,056
誰を生きたか忘れちゃった！
I forgot who I lived as!

510
00:39:06,056 --> 00:39:11,856
あなたに命が戻るなら 届くなら
If life returns to you, if it reaches you,

511
00:39:12,056 --> 00:39:17,856
わたしはどうなろうと構わないのに
